33ac052=3D""><div class=3D"full-width" data-v-033ac052=3D""><h3 data-v-033a=
c052=3D"">What is NoSQL injection?</h3><div class=3D"block__body_markdown_c=
ontent__html amp-unmask" data-v-033ac052=3D""><p>NoSQL injection is a type =
of vulnerability where an attacker is able to inject arbitrary text into No=
SQL queries. NoSQL injections are very similar to the traditional <a target=
=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" href=3D"https://learn.snyk.io/lesso=
ns/sql-injection/">SQL injection attack</a>, except that the attack is agai=
nst a NoSQL database. NoSQL is a general term for any database that does no=
t use SQL, a common database management system (DBMS) that utilizes NoSQL i=
s MongoDB.</p>
</div></div></div></div><!--[--><!--]--></div><div class=3D"block" style=3D=
