dy_markdown_content__html amp-unmask" data-v-033ac052=3D""><ul>
<li>NoSQL databases are vulnerable to injection vulnerabilities </li>
<li>NoSQL injections can potentially be more dangerous than SQL injections,=
 as you may be able to execute code in the context of the application, not =
just the database</li>
<li>Remediate NoSQL injections by sanitizing your user-supplied input. You =
can do this with the popular helper library =E2=80=9CMongo-Sanitize=E2=80=
=9D or using the =E2=80=9Cvalidator=E2=80=9D npm library to validate any us=
er-supplied input</li>
