ing content within the expandable  --><!--[--><div class=3D"faqs__answer am=
p-unmask" data-v-72270c7e=3D""><p>NoSQL injection is a type of vulnerabilit=
y where an attacker is able to inject arbitrary text into NoSQL queries. No=
SQL injections are very similar to the traditional SQL injection attack, ex=
cept that the attack is against a NoSQL database. NoSQL is a general term f=
or any database that does not use SQL, a common database management system =
(DBMS) that utilizes NoSQL is MongoDB.</p>
</div><!--]--></section><!--]--></div></div><div class=3D"expandable expand=
