ata-v-0882385f=3D""><!-- @slot for placing content within the expandable  -=
-><!--[--><div class=3D"faqs__answer amp-unmask" data-v-72270c7e=3D""><p>As=
 is often the case with injection vulnerabilities, you must sanitize the us=
er-supplied input to prevent NoSQL injections. It=E2=80=99s very important =
to strictly validate any user-supplied input before it makes its way to any=
 query string, NoSQL databases are not an exception to this rule!</p>
